-- =============================================================================
-- MIGRATION 001: CORE SCHEMA, EXTENSIONS, ENUMS, TABLES, CONSTRAINTS & INDEXES
-- Project: Notre Dame College (NDC) Alumni Platform
-- Target: Supabase PostgreSQL (Designed for 100,000+ Alumni Scale)
